# The Road to Aht Urhgan (jeuno 91): Wajaom Woodlands' afterZoneIn reads Prog. Accepted by a GM at Prog 3: the
# zone-in (a warp to the leypoint) and 4 s: nothing; Prog 4 (a GM): out and back in: the Boarding Permit and the Map of
# Wajaom Woodlands, Prog 5; a second zone-in at Prog 5: nothing.
lists WajaomWoodlands/afterZoneIn/1
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=39.5,4.1,-45.2 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.TheRoadToAhtUrhgan accepted
charvar Quest[3][91]Prog 3
login
warp -200.1,-10,79.9 WajaomWoodlands
tick 4500                           # afterZoneIn at Prog 3: nothing
charvar Quest[3][91]Prog 4          # a GM
warp 39.5,4.1,-45.2 LowerJeuno
warp -200.1,-10,79.9 WajaomWoodlands
tick 3000                           # no afterZoneIn yet
tick 1000                           # afterZoneIn at Prog 4: the Boarding Permit, the Map of Wajaom Woodlands; Prog 5
warp 39.5,4.1,-45.2 LowerJeuno
warp -200.1,-10,79.9 WajaomWoodlands
tick 4500                           # afterZoneIn at Prog 5: nothing
